 'This is a reminder to attend the Compulsory Day School for Lecture Group 
 04 (L04) on Saturday\, 28 November 2026\, according to your official tutor
 ial group.' and 'T47 - T52: 1:00 pm - 4:00 pm'. His tutorial group is T48
 \, so the afternoon band is his session. This settles the October confirma
 tion the earlier verification was waiting on\; 21 Nov is not his date.\n\n
 Session clock: 13:00 trainer briefing on the AI tools\, 14:00 first draft 
 of Worksheet 3 (Task E Campaign Promotion)\, 15:00 tutor consultation\, 15
 :30 finalise\, 15:30-16:00 upload Worksheet 3 on OLE. Attendance is taken 
 for the whole session: 'Absence\, lateness\, or leaving before the end of 
 your session may result in failure of the course.' Bring laptop + data acc
 ess\, HKMU student ID AND HKID/passport (tutors check ID)\, name badge on 
 arrival\, casual clothes + sports shoes (no skirt\, heels or sandals)\, wa
 ter and a jacket. Create free accounts for the HKMU ChatGPT portal and Can
 va beforehand. Tools used: HKMU ChatGPT portal\, Canva\, Leonardo.Ai.
