DTSTAMP:20260918T130000Z
UID:b6ef18ac38a206dc7f8349098d63adc1@hkmu
DESCRIPTION:100 marks\, four questions: Q1 DRAM chip with 10 address pins 
 and 8 data pins plus RAS/CAS (12 marks). Q2 PC2-6400 DDR SDRAM with tCL-tR
 CD-tRP-tRAS = 2-7-9-10\, including the memory cycle time for 8 consecutive
  datawords without precharge (24 marks). Q3 two set-associative caches\, c
 omplete the parameter table (40 marks). Q4 the LPDDR video\, three advanta
 ges of LPDDR4(x) over LPDDR3 and of LPDDR5 over LPDDR4(x) (24 marks). Draw
  on Lecture 1-3 and Tutorials 2-3. PDF only\, name + student number on pag
 e 1\, show steps\, upload to OLE\, never by email.
END:VEVENT
